  nonce: 7b5a  # 7b5a
  message: "WI-saful option (1) merged (PR #2762). Prior investigation showed propagating access_mode to dispatches_to/uses was either a no-op or a regression. The real blocker was forward dataflow not crossing write->read boundaries, now fixed. Bakeoff validation needed: run deep-bakeoff on prometheus and confirm LOW_DATAFLOW_SLICE_RATIO is cleared. If it persists, escalate to WI-hukoh option (2) dest_access_mode population; otherwise mark satisfied."  # 7b5a
